OL,3,ACall to raise tax thresholds among
OL,4,Aunion demands ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnions who donate to Labour will meet
OL,7,FJohn Healey on Thursday to press home
OL,8,Ftheir demands ahead of next month's
OL,9,FBudget.
OL,11,FUnite, the UK's second biggest union,
OL,12,Fhas called for a reversal of the
OL,13,Ffreezing of tax thresholds, that see
OL,14,Fthe lowest paid drawn into paying tax.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
