OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACall to raise tax thresholds among
OL,4,Aunion demands ahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe union's leader, Sharon Graham, said
OL,7,Fshe told Andy Burnham that the cut to
OL,8,Fthe winter fuel allowance, carried out
OL,9,Funder former Prime Minister Sir Keir
OL,10,FStarmer, was a "disgrace", adding:
OL,11,F"What to you need to do is winter fuel
OL,12,Fin reverse - something that says to
OL,13,Feveryday people I am on your side."
OL,15,FThe call is one of a number of policy
OL,16,Fproposals unions are taking to the
OL,17,Fchancellor, including increased taxes
OL,18,Fon tech companies.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
